Package: ukui-dynamic-island
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31), libgl1, libegl1, libglib2.0-0, libxcb1, libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-randr0, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-xinerama0, libxcb-xkb1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libdbus-1-3, libgssapi-krb5-2, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libxrender1, libsm6, libice6, fonts-noto-cjk
Recommends: pulseaudio-utils, upower, dbus, x11-utils, fcitx-frontend-qt5
Suggests: xdotool, wmctrl, nvidia-smi
Maintainer: longyuxiang <longyuxiang@kylinos.cn>
Homepage: https://github.com/longxiucai
Description: Dynamic island for the Kylin UKUI desktop
 A top-edge island for Kylin V10 SP1 / UKUI on X11: clock, battery,
 media, weather, todos, mail, calendar, quotas and system monitors.
 Hover to expand, five skins, three shapes.
 The bundle carries its own Qt runtime; no system Python packages are used.
